{"server":"en","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-07_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-07","title":"The Tyrant","storyCode":"1-7","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2b0b203a73452e2f441a5748e819e94098aae43aab2a0ab1c0a1ce9642413c7f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"The Doctor makes a valiant effort to rescue a medic operator, and is put in harm's way in the process. Fortunately, Nearl comes to the rescue once more.\nEven with an ominous storm about to fall, Reunion continues to attack.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Prepare for impact!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Spread out—!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"There's too much coming... at this rate, every single building in this city is going to be destroyed!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"This is looking bad...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to relocate!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Hold on!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaagh!! It's falling... It's falling!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"The sky is crashing down!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aghhhh! It hurtsss...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"My hand... my hand! Where's my hand..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"No, no way!! I don't want to die...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaaaaghh!!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Defenders!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Protect our Casters! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"...!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"What's that sound?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"A massive cluster just toppled the building across the street from us! Get down! !"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Eeek...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"... Don't stand there... Medic! Watch out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh no... Medic, get out of there!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......!","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaahh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh, D-Doctor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"The Doctor pushed the medic out of the way? Wouldn't that mean... Doctor...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"No, Doctor!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"N-Nearl's charging forward!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Get down, Doctor!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Aagh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"She made it in time!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"She did it... She saved the Doctor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough*... Haah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl! Doctor! Hurry back over here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I can still hold my shield...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Jump, Doctor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Jump!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, Doctor..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You're, you're not hurt?"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"I'm fine... It's no big deal.","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"...","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Thanks for saving me, Nearl.","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"How could you... put yourself in danger like that!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"At least take me with you, so I can protect you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't allow you to be harmed..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Especially, right before my eyes!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We should count ourselves lucky that everyone is still safe...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(How much longer is this going to last?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(How long are we going to be able to stay alive?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"... Hm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are fewer rocks falling now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"So we managed to weather the first impact..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"But we have to be careful still. Nobody knows how long this Catastrophe will continue for."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"At least... we weren't caught dead in the middle of it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"We were lucky to slip through."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmhm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"How's everyone doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like all of the Operators made it through just fine...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"Some were lightly injured, but considering the circumstances, we were quite fortunate!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Guard","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"We... we made it!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Some of the Reunion members have also..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh... Ahh! ! Rhodes Island!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"...What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Arghh...!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"They're still trying to attack us?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong with you bunch!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Come back here...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"They've gone insane."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Do they not value their lives at all?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dobermann..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"We have no choice..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll suppress them first, and then immediately relocate!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["Guard"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["Dobermann"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["Nearl"]}]}
